      "created_at": "2017-08-22T15:18:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, we had someone let us know this last night. Glad we have awesome people to set us straight. The mistake doesn't change our opinion of the game, but it does make it more challenging, which is awesome because that was my one complaint about our plays. So now that it's more challenging, I am excited to try and take on those evil invaders.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks again!</p>",
